window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"It's all about the swagger in the Midnight Court because a first impression might be all you get.\"<br> <br> After bringing a bloodhungry demon back to Valen, Breed's life is saved by a prince of the Midnight Court.<br> <br> But all is not well in the greatest city in the Empire. Revolution is in the air, gangs are fighting for supremacy, and plague is spreading.<br> <br> Armed with little more than a kitchen knife and a bad attitude, Breed must fight for a place in the Midnight Court and wreak revenge on Duke Leopold and the creature wearing Mother Blake's skin.<br> <br> Where There's a Blade is the sixth and final audiobook in The Chronicles of Breed.</p>"; 
